  "description": "The target community is individuals who hold Islamophobic views or are predisposed to anti-Muslim sentiment. The meme is designed to resonate with those who perceive Islam as inherently violent, barbaric, or incompatible with Western values, particularly through the use of stereotypes such as the oppression of women, violence, and the prohibition of pork. The visual of a Muslim man in prayer juxtaposed with hateful text is intended to provoke outrage and reinforce negative stereotypes about Muslims, making it primarily aimed at audiences who already harbor prejudice against Islam and Muslim communities.",
